OL,3,GNEWSAMajor road closed following
OL,4,Atwo-vehicle collision
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have closed a major road in
OL,7,FBristol following a crash involving two
OL,8,Fvehicles.
OL,10,FThe collision happened at about 04:00
OL,11,FGMT on the A37 Wells Road at its
OL,12,Fjunction with Airport Road and Wootton
OL,13,FPark in south Bristol.
OL,15,FEmergency services remain at the scene
OL,16,Fand traffic monitoring website Inrix
OL,17,Fsaid the Wells Road and A4174
OL,18,FCallington Road were closed in both
OL,19,Fdirections.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
