OL,3,GNEWSAMajor road closed following
OL,4,Atwo-vehicle collision
OL,5,
OL,6,FAvon and Somerset Police said the
OL,7,Fclosures were expected to remain for
OL,8,Fseveral hours while investigations were
OL,9,Funder way. Anyone who witnessed the
OL,10,Fincident is urged to contact police.
